"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} press {ph2} {ph3}, type {ph4}Terminal{ph5} and press Enter."
msgstr "{ph0}macOS:{ph1} กด {ph2} {ph3} พิมพ์ {ph4}Terminal{ph5} แล้วกด Enter"

